<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Baloise.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Baloise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued a total of three million American-style call warrants, on Baloise, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2500.OO SFR	     PREMIUM	10.10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.50 SFR		  GEARING	6.0 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 05.SEP.96-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	04.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   ZURICH		    MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2680.00 SFR</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
